flowchart TD
    A[User Request] --> B{Observer:<br/>Intent Classification}
    
    B -->|Read-only| C[Observer executes<br/>read MCP tools]
    C --> D[Synthesize response]
    D --> E[Stream response to user]
    
    B -->|State-changing| F[Observer builds<br/>handoff payload]
    F --> G[Handoff to Operator<br/>required_tool + targets + scope]
    
    G --> H{Targets resolved?}
    H -->|No| I[Operator: discovery read<br/>to resolve targets]
    I --> H
    H -->|Yes| J[Create pending action<br/>needs_approval = true]
    
    J --> K[Stream confirmation<br/>request to user]
    K --> L{User decision}
    
    L -->|Confirm| M[Execute MCP tool<br/>with resolved args]
    M --> N[Operator returns result]
    N --> O[Handoff back to Observer]
    O --> E
    
    L -->|Cancel| P[Discard pending action]
    P --> O

    style B fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff
    style G fill:#e8a838,color:#fff
    style J fill:#d94a4a,color:#fff
    style L fill:#5cb85c,color:#fff
    style M fill:#d94a4a,color:#fff
